# The API image's build context (issue #292): the repo's `.dockerignore` plus
# `models/`. BuildKit reads this file, not the root one, for
# `docker/api.Dockerfile`. The root file leaves `models/` in because the
# reranker image copies its ONNX weights from there; the API never ships them.
# Keep the two in step: tests/test_api_image.py compares them.

# secrets and local configuration
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
credentials*.json
service-account*.json
.claude

# history and tooling
.git
.github
.gitignore
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.pyright
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.fastembed_cache

# the reranker's ONNX weights (2.27 GB at fp32): built, not shipped with the API
models

# tests and what only they read
tests
docs
demo
scripts
ci
prompts
corpus/golden
corpus/mappings
corpus/instruments/**/raw
db

# local data
data
*.db
*.sqlite
